guide forever/class/warlock/tome-of-sacrifice
title Tome of Sacrifice
category Class
class Warlock
folder Warlock
levels 60-60
zone Blasted Lands
keywords The Prison's Bindings, The Prison's Casing, Suppression, Daio the Decrepit, Tainted Scar, Satyr Blood, Tears of the Hederine, Glowing Crystal Prison, Doomguard Commander, Tome of Sacrifice, Dire Maul, Warpwood Quarter, Darkwhisper Gorge, Warlock, class quest
reward item 18602
why A rare off-hand at 60, Daio's payment for capturing a Doomguard Commander in the Blasted Lands.

# Daio the Decrepit's chain in the Tainted Scar: The Prison's Bindings (7581,
# Satyr Blood from the Warpwood Quarter of Dire Maul), The Prison's Casing
# (7582, Tears of the Hederine from Darkwhisper Gorge in Winterspring) and
# Suppression (7583, capturing a Doomguard Commander), for the Tome of
# Sacrifice.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie
# 12.1.0 and Questie-Forever) for Daio, the droppers, the Doomguard Commander
# and the Imprisoned Doomguard; Forever's Warlock class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/): unchanged in Forever,
# Suppression rewards the Tome of Sacrifice; the classic quest data
# (quests 7581, 7582, 7583) for where the satyrs and the
# Hederine live and for using the Glowing Crystal Prison on the Commander.
# The Wildspawn satyrs, the Hederine and the Doomguard Commander are all
# elite: grouping up is advised, and the satyrs are inside Dire Maul, a
# dungeon. The data has no position for the satyrs or Dire Maul's entrances;
# the Warpwood Quarter's back door at Lariss Pavilion, behind Azj'Tordin
# (whose position is in npcs.json), needs the Crescent Key; without it, go in
# by Dire Maul's main entrances (Warcraft Tavern, "Dire Maul East",
# warcrafttavern.com/wow-classic/guides/dire-maul-east, a Classic source).
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so nothing here has been checked in game.

step Daio the Decrepit
  tip At 60 Daio the Decrepit waits in the Tainted Scar, in western Blasted Lands.
  level 60
  accept 7581                         -- Daio the Decrepit
  accept 7582

step Satyr Blood
  zone Feralas
  tip The Wildspawn satyrs of the Warpwood Quarter, Dire Maul's eastern wing, carry the blood. The back door at Lariss Pavilion, north of Camp Mojache, needs the Crescent Key; otherwise go in by Dire Maul's main entrance. Bring a group.
  collect 18603 quest 7581.1 @76.9,37.4 -- Satyr Blood, inside the Warpwood Quarter

step Tears of the Hederine
  zone Winterspring
  tip The Hederine demons hold Darkwhisper Gorge, in southern Winterspring. They are elite: grouping up is advised.
  collect 18604 quest 7582.1          -- Tears of the Hederine

step Suppression
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip Hand both in to Daio, then find the Doomguard Commander in the Tainted Scar and use the Glowing Crystal Prison on him. He is elite and fights to escape: grouping up is advised.
  turnin 7581                         -- Daio the Decrepit
  turnin 7582                         -- Daio the Decrepit
  accept 7583
  use 18601 @34.5,63.7                -- Glowing Crystal Prison, on the Doomguard Commander
  collect 18605 quest 7583.1          -- Imprisoned Doomguard

step Back to Daio
  turnin 7583                         -- Daio the Decrepit: Tome of Sacrifice
